1
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,280
Are you sure you want to plead guilty?

2
00:01:40,079 --> 00:01:40,799
I'm sure.

3
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:43,840
Give up your accomplices, and you could get a reduced sentence.

4
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,359
I acted alone.

5
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:47,840
Then sign here.

6
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:14,159
Dad took all the blame

7
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,120
and kept me completely out of it.

8
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:21,039
Everyone thinks

9
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,280
he was the one who kidnapped and killed the hostage.

10
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,159
But the truth is,

11
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,520
the truth is,

12
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:36,639
he wasn't the one who killed that little boy.

13
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,080
It was me.

14
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,680
It wasn't your fault that child died.

15
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:05,360
It was an accident, Ding Ning.

16
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,360
Your mom...

17
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,719
Does she know about this?

18
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,919
No one knows about it.

19
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:25,719
It's not that I haven't tried telling her,

20
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,479
but every time I worked up the courage

21
00:03:31,479 --> 00:03:32,919
to bring it up to her,

22
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,879
she would instinctively resist it.

23
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,520
She probably just didn't want to recall

24
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,319
her relationship with my dad anymore.

25
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,319
Besides, she has a new life now.

26
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:47,680
Even if I told her, it wouldn't change anything.

27
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:51,000
It really wasn't your fault, Ding Ning.

28
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,120
Why did your father

29
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,960
have to bring a five or six-year-old child

30
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,319
to a kidnapping scene,

31
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:02,439
and make you take care of another child?

32
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:06,599
What do you think you could have done back then?

33
00:04:09,319 --> 00:04:10,360
It's been twenty years.

34
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,960
Ever since that day,

35
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,800
I've been locked inside that closet.

36
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,959
Locked in there for twenty years.

37
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,680
I originally thought

38
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:22,720
that for the rest of my life,

39
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,360
I'd never dare to open that closet door again.

40
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:27,759
But then I met you.

41
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:33,839
Lao Yu,

42
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:36,600
you and Awu

43
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,800
are incredibly important to me.

44
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,560
When I'm with you two,

45
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:45,160
I truly feel happy and grounded.

46
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,279
It feels like everything I missed out on

47
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,560
has been made up for.

48
00:04:51,639 --> 00:04:52,560
But now,

49
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,040
the reality before us

50
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,560
is something we have to face.

51
00:05:02,439 --> 00:05:03,319
Listen to me,

52
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:06,639
I don't want to lose you guys,

53
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,439
but I also can't watch another child

54
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:10,800
be wrongly accused.

55
00:05:12,439 --> 00:05:13,240
That child...

56
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:14,680
I have to save him.

57
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,279
To save that child,

58
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,319
there is only one way.

59
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,639
You need to cooperate with me,

60
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:28,800
and use Zhao Yijie to infiltrate Mr. Bi's inner circle.

61
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,199
No problem.

62
00:05:32,319 --> 00:05:34,079
We'll do exactly as you say.

63
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:39,639
Thank you

64
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:42,319
for trusting me,

65
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:47,560
and for treating me

66
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,480
as your own family.

67
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,920
That brings me a lot of comfort.

68
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,079
Really.

69
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,839
Life really works in mysterious ways.

70
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,199
It brings you to despair,

71
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:05,120
then gives you a glimmer of hope.

72
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:09,279
Yang A'wu...

73
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,959
is your biological grandson, isn't he?

74
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,759
I've actually always wanted to confess this to you,

75
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,240
but I honestly didn't know

76
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,560
how to bring it up.

77
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:29,160
Well, now,

78
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,759
I can finally let this secret out.

79
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,639
Do you want to hear it?

80
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,560
It's just you today.

81
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,040
Yes.

82
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,839
I already know.

83
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,519
I can handle this.

84
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:38,800
You should tell the police the truth.

85
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,079
I said, I can handle this.

86
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,000
If they hadn't arranged for you to go there,

87
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,600
if they hadn't pushed you time and again,

88
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,120
you wouldn't have done it at all.

89
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,160
I know they even gave you

90
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,399
psychological training for interrogations.

91
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:52,959
It definitely included

92
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,639
when a lawyer advises you to tell the truth,

93
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:55,560
how you should resist.

94
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,680
But, Lu Zhiyong,

95
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:59,319
you're not out of options.

96
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,920
If you change your mind,

97
00:08:03,439 --> 00:08:05,160
Fan Dong and I will do everything we can

98
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,279
to get your life back to normal.

99
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,240
What about the money?

100
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,279
You should only earn the kind of money

101
00:08:12,279 --> 00:08:13,720
that lets you sleep at night.

102
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,399
I don't care if I can sleep at night.

103
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,160
I only care if my mom can.

104
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:18,079
Before,

105
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,160
my mom worked five jobs a month,

106
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,920
only slept three or four hours a day,

107
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,519
and made just three thousand yuan a month.

108
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,160
Now,

109
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:26,639
she makes thirty thousand a month.

110
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,079
Lu Zhiyong, you don't understand.

111
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,680
After I'm convicted,

112
00:08:30,279 --> 00:08:31,439
they'll also let me

113
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:33,399
live in a big house like the ones my dad built.

114
00:08:33,399 --> 00:08:34,399
His name is Fang Quan.

115
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,000
Quan as in spring water.

116
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,639
Twenty-six, unmarried.

117
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,159
He worked at a parts factory,

118
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:42,320
but he got out.

119
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,480
Before you guys stabbed him to death,

120
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,440
he had just bought a high-speed train ticket home,

121
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:49,240
planning to go back to Lingchuan County for the New Year.

122
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,879
Just like your mother,

123
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,919
he wanted to work hard and make money in this city.

124
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,679
I'm not listening!

125
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,639
No, you want to hear it.

126
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:59,360
In fact, you want to hear it the most.

127
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:01,600
You think about it day and night, you can't sleep.

128
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,879
It's all you think about.

129
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,519
He didn't die!

130
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:07,679
I didn't kill anyone!

131
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:08,679
You also want to know,

132
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:10,360
if you took every one of those stabs yourself,

133
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,600
what it would feel like.

134
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:16,840
You can't wait to be punished.

135
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,120
You are completely trapped in

136
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,399
the moment you killed him.

137
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:20,080
You can never...

138
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,960
Take me back!

139
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,240
I want to leave!

140
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:23,759
Take me away!

141
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,120
I'm not waiting for my mom anymore!

142
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:26,320
I want to go back!

143
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,759
Take me away!

144
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:45,120
You should only earn the kind

145
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,720
of money that lets you sleep at night.

146
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,840
After a few years in there,

147
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,759
you'll still be young when you get out.

148
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,759
When you get out,

149
00:10:06,039 --> 00:10:08,200
you and your mom will be able to live

150
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,679
in a nice house like the ones your dad built.

151
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,080
You can even have a car.

152
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:14,039
And

153
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:17,120
you and your mom can get

154
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:19,039
a very well-paying job.

155
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,360
What do you say?

156
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:32,440
Have a seat.

157
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,600
Did you figure it out after our last chat?

158
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,879
I'll do as you say.

159
00:10:44,799 --> 00:10:45,440
Okay.

160
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,279
But Ding Ning,

161
00:10:50,519 --> 00:10:52,600
I'm not the only examiner this time.

162
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:54,919
What do you mean?

163
00:10:56,519 --> 00:10:57,679
After finishing this case,

164
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,559
you can make me a law firm partner?

165
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,360
A law firm partner

166
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,639
is worthless in your eyes.

167
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,480
I know your ambition.

168
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,840
What I can tell you is,

169
00:11:11,559 --> 00:11:14,080
the false litigation base was a mock exam.

170
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,919
Lu's case

171
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,679
is the real test.

172
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,440
Ding Ning.

173
00:11:25,879 --> 00:11:26,600
Everything you want

174
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,159
to have

175
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:31,080
is just one step away.

176
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,000
So could you,

177
00:11:33,639 --> 00:11:36,360
no matter how far your investigation has gone,

178
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:40,080
help that kid plead guilty as soon as possible?

179
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:42,279
Okay?

180
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:53,360
Lu's case has ruined too many people.

181
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,720
Fan Dong,

182
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,759
Lu Zhiyong himself, his mom,

183
00:11:59,120 --> 00:11:59,759
and even...

184
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:00,919
even Yang A'wu.

185
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,759
I guarantee you,

186
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,559
Awu will absolutely not

187
00:12:06,559 --> 00:12:07,919
get involved in this murder case.

188
00:12:09,399 --> 00:12:11,600
But you've seen Lao Yu's usual worries.

189
00:12:13,159 --> 00:12:16,080
If one day Lu loses his mind

190
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,840
and confesses to the burglary with Awu,

191
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,919
things will get much more complicated.

192
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:28,440
I know.

193
00:12:31,679 --> 00:12:32,120
Good.

194
00:12:33,559 --> 00:12:35,240
Then I'll go be a math teacher now.

195
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:48,200
Come on, math class.

196
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,320
No math. No class.

197
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:52,879
No class.

198
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:54,399
Okay.

199
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,559
No class.

200
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:00,679
Then let's just chat.

201
00:13:01,399 --> 00:13:02,080
About what?

202
00:13:02,559 --> 00:13:04,360
About what?

203
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:08,039
Let's talk about Sister Ding Ning, okay?

204
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,320
Do you like her?

205
00:13:10,799 --> 00:13:11,440
I do.

206
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,000
What do you like about her?

207
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:17,279
She lets me have my way. She's so warm.

208
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,159
Compared to Grandpa, who do you like more?

209
00:13:23,759 --> 00:13:24,600
I like both.

210
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,679
But I still want to take care of Grandpa more.

211
00:13:29,519 --> 00:13:31,799
Good boy, you've grown up.

212
00:13:33,559 --> 00:13:37,240
What do you think of Dad?

213
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:38,799
Dad?

214
00:13:39,879 --> 00:13:41,879
Do you mean the dad who's locked up?

215
00:13:45,279 --> 00:13:46,600
I mean me.

216
00:13:48,679 --> 00:13:49,200
Right.

217
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:52,600
What do you think of Zhao Yijie?

218
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:00,960
Never mind.

219
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:11,840
Did he give you a hard time?

220
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:15,720
It was okay.

221
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,279
He just urged me

222
00:14:17,279 --> 00:14:18,919
to hurry up and wrap up Lu Zhiyong's case.

223
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,559
Then what are you hesitating for?

224
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:29,879
I don't know.

225
00:14:30,679 --> 00:14:31,320
Lao Yu,

226
00:14:32,879 --> 00:14:34,120
I just feel something is wrong.

227
00:14:35,039 --> 00:14:36,240
I know what you're thinking.

228
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,679
In your previous nursing home rape case,

229
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:41,799
Chang Yu also made you rush the process

230
00:14:42,039 --> 00:14:43,519
and ignore the truth.

231
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,279
So this time you feel that

232
00:14:45,279 --> 00:14:47,039
everything has gone back to square one.

233
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,279
But this time, you're not alone.

234
00:14:54,919 --> 00:14:56,600
Compared to a year ago,

235
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,879
you're no longer fighting on your own.

236
00:15:01,799 --> 00:15:03,679
He deliberately told me just now

237
00:15:04,399 --> 00:15:05,799
that I'm not alone anymore.

238
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:10,159
It felt like there was a hidden meaning.

239
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,279
If I had more time,

240
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,960
I could play with you a little longer.

241
00:15:14,279 --> 00:15:15,080
It's fine.

242
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,679
But this time is really different.

243
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,320
This matter

244
00:15:22,159 --> 00:15:24,559
involves way too many people.

245
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:29,279
So, let's get through the process quickly.

246
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,200
I'll accompany you to the next stage.

247
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,840
He has already figured it out.

248
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,320
Anyway, his strategy has changed.

249
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:41,720
It seems he's getting serious.

250
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,600
Look,

251
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:45,159
with everything before,

252
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:47,799
the focus of his strategy was control.

253
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,679
But this time,

254
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:50,639
he seems to really be letting me do as I please.

255
00:15:50,879 --> 00:15:54,480
So he clearly knows I'm investigating him,

256
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,000
and he knows you're looking into him, too.

257
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,159
It's not even hard to guess

258
00:15:57,159 --> 00:15:58,679
that we've teamed up against him.

259
00:15:58,919 --> 00:16:02,320
Yet he still lets us do whatever we want.

260
00:16:04,039 --> 00:16:05,320
That's what's so strange.

261
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:07,039
I don't know what you think,

262
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,320
but I feel like

263
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:10,919
Zhao Yijie has truly changed.

264
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:12,200
That's impossible.

265
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,080
This guy,

266
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,799
he can't change his nature.

267
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:22,759
Trust me.

268
00:16:29,399 --> 00:16:30,600
Anyway, no matter what,

269
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,320
right now,

270
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,080
the only thing we can be sure of is

271
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:36,120
that Lu Zhiyong's case

272
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,960
is a major concern for Zhao Yijie and his people.

273
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:41,120
And I think

274
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,120
used such extreme methods

275
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,799
to protect a kid...

276
00:16:45,799 --> 00:16:47,320
Is that kid really that important?

277
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:48,960
What's your relationship with him?

278
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,639
Or is there some force behind him

279
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:52,559
making you do this?

280
00:16:52,559 --> 00:16:53,799
making you do this?

281
00:16:53,799 --> 00:16:56,000
I had no choice.

282
00:16:56,519 --> 00:16:57,639
I believe

283
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:03,159
the true culprit's father is Mr. Bi himself.

284
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,000
Let's go over the situation.

285
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:20,400
Three days ago, Zhou Hao told me

286
00:17:22,079 --> 00:17:23,559
that a colleague from the finance department

287
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:25,000
went and had a fight with Xu Ruqing.

288
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,119
"How do you expect me to record this?

289
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:27,440
If it can't be explained clearly,

290
00:17:27,519 --> 00:17:29,279
I'll be the one held legally responsible!"

291
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:35,039
Director Xu, the case files.

292
00:17:35,039 --> 00:17:36,039
They're on the desk. Take them yourself.

293
00:17:41,039 --> 00:17:42,960
Zhou Hao took the chance to secretly photograph some documents.

294
00:17:43,559 --> 00:17:45,319
He found that on New Year's Day,

295
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,839
which was after the murder

296
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,559
and before Lu turned himself in,

297
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:51,519
under the expenses of the charity foundation,

298
00:17:51,519 --> 00:17:53,599
there were a few strangely large disbursements.

299
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:54,960
The payee was a company

300
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:57,240
that had never appeared before.

301
00:17:57,559 --> 00:17:59,200
And the address of this company

302
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,039
belongs to a jewelry store.

303
00:18:05,319 --> 00:18:06,000
Hello, sir.

304
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:06,799
How may I help you?

305
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:08,119
What's interesting is

306
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,119
that on the second day of the New Year, this jewelry store

307
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:13,799
hired a store supervisor.

308
00:18:14,599 --> 00:18:15,759
So this is

309
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:16,640
what Lu meant when he mentioned

310
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,359
the source of his mother's 30,000-yuan monthly salary.

311
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:21,920
And even if someone investigated,

312
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:24,039
it'd be hard to find anything fishy about it.

313
00:18:25,039 --> 00:18:26,559
The Rujie Charity Foundation

314
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,960
paid out such a large sum of money

315
00:18:29,359 --> 00:18:30,720
because on the surface,

316
00:18:31,039 --> 00:18:33,119
they were investing in this jewelry store.

317
00:18:33,279 --> 00:18:34,079
Investing?

318
00:18:34,359 --> 00:18:37,359
Which was then converted into his mother's salary.

319
00:18:38,079 --> 00:18:40,319
It's a method that's hard to detect.

320
00:18:42,559 --> 00:18:43,400
What about the house?

321
00:18:43,759 --> 00:18:44,680
Didn't Zhao Yijie say

322
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,400
he would buy them a house?

323
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,359
Zhou Hao looked into that, too.

324
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,279
You wouldn't even believe

325
00:18:50,279 --> 00:18:52,039
how quickly they managed

326
00:18:52,279 --> 00:18:54,240
to come up with this solution.

327
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,599
Especially those

328
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,519
whom I had once forgotten,

329
00:18:58,519 --> 00:19:00,039
who made significant contributions

330
00:19:00,039 --> 00:19:01,759
to our group's development.

331
00:19:02,119 --> 00:19:03,200
Please welcome them to the stage!

332
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:05,559
Today, I have decided

333
00:19:05,599 --> 00:19:07,279
to give each of them a house.

334
00:19:07,759 --> 00:19:09,880
The time Lu Zhiyong's parents received the gift

335
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:10,680
was exactly

336
00:19:10,680 --> 00:19:13,160
three days after Lu Zhiyong turned himself in.

337
00:19:13,279 --> 00:19:14,759
This is Zhao Yijie taking advantage of

338
00:19:14,759 --> 00:19:17,720
Lu's father being injured, right?

339
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:19,359
Right.

340
00:19:19,759 --> 00:19:20,799
The acquisition of the house

341
00:19:20,799 --> 00:19:22,680
was framed as compensation for his father's paralysis,

342
00:19:22,759 --> 00:19:24,599
a payment he was denied for years

343
00:19:24,599 --> 00:19:26,200
by the real estate company.

344
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,920
And the official reason given

345
00:19:28,039 --> 00:19:30,640
was that the real estate boss grew a conscience

346
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,920
and wanted to give back to his employees.

347
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,920
Isn't that complete fantasy?

348
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,720
But there's no need to be so discouraged.

349
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:40,000
If this case is really as you say,

350
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,960
something that happened over the New Year,

351
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,440
then there must be loopholes

352
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:45,039
that Zhao Yijie's people had to cover up.

353
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:47,279
There's one more person you need to watch out for.

354
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:48,559
Lao Kong.

355
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:50,039
Lao Kong?

356
00:19:53,759 --> 00:19:55,759
Lao Kong is already very wary of you.

357
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,720
So as early as that day,

358
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:01,200
before you came clean to me on the bridge,

359
00:20:01,799 --> 00:20:03,119
I had already arranged for a rookie

360
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:04,160
to keep an eye on Lao Kong.

361
00:20:05,039 --> 00:20:05,599
Who?

362
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,799
It's not Navel Song, is it?

363
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,960
He's notorious.

364
00:20:17,599 --> 00:20:18,920
Do you think that's credible?

365
00:20:22,599 --> 00:20:23,359
Lao Kong.

366
00:20:25,119 --> 00:20:25,960
Everyone knows him.

367
00:20:27,039 --> 00:20:29,279
But this guy is not to be messed with.

368
00:20:30,559 --> 00:20:31,400
Let's hear it.

369
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,680
See that?

370
00:20:36,559 --> 00:20:37,599
Some lawyers,

371
00:20:37,799 --> 00:20:39,400
just like you and Zhao Yijie,

372
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,799
look glamorous.

373
00:20:40,839 --> 00:20:41,680
And some

374
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,759
are like Chang Yu, focusing on volume.

375
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:45,680
I'm like them, just hustling for scraps.

376
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,839
The bottom tier.

377
00:20:48,359 --> 00:20:51,640
But the difference you can see

378
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:53,079
isn't the biggest difference.

379
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:55,599
What is the difference?

380
00:20:56,559 --> 00:20:57,640
The biggest difference is

381
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,599
whether you have someone like Lao Kong.

382
00:20:59,839 --> 00:21:00,720
What kind of man is Lao Kong?

383
00:21:01,039 --> 00:21:03,200
Lao Kong does all the dirty work.

384
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,599
The people around him

385
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:06,200
are absolutely ruthless.

386
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:09,039
But if you try to buy Lao Kong off now,

387
00:21:09,519 --> 00:21:10,799
at his current level,

388
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:12,680
he doesn't answer to anyone exclusively.

389
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:15,880
Didn't you say he works for Zhao Yijie?

390
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,279
Yeah.

391
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:21,960
That's because he chose to be Zhao Yijie's man.

392
00:21:23,599 --> 00:21:24,400
Let's put it this way.

393
00:21:24,519 --> 00:21:27,279
A lot of people owe him favors.

394
00:21:27,759 --> 00:21:30,920
If you want to replace Zhao Yijie,

395
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,920
you really need someone like Lao Kong.

396
00:21:33,079 --> 00:21:34,160
And the more, the better.

397
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:44,480
Compared to Lao Kong, what do you think

398
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,200
you're missing?

399
00:21:50,839 --> 00:21:51,680
What am I missing?

400
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:53,400
What do I lack?

401
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,400
Well, here's the thing.

402
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,079
You see,

403
00:21:58,480 --> 00:21:59,720
tailing Lao Kong

404
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:02,480
is no easy task.

405
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:05,759
It's much harder than tailing Yu Songfan.

406
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,880
And if he catches me,

407
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:09,960
I might even lose my life.

408
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:11,599
Name your price.

409
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:14,880
Well, this time,

410
00:22:15,319 --> 00:22:16,680
I'm not asking for money.

411
00:22:18,920 --> 00:22:19,720
I'm risking it all.

412
00:22:20,079 --> 00:22:20,839
I want something bigger.

413
00:22:21,079 --> 00:22:23,119
Even though I can never be

414
00:22:23,119 --> 00:22:24,440
someone like Lao Kong,

415
00:22:25,119 --> 00:22:26,240
you still have to

416
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:29,440
prove that you can replace Zhao Yijie.

417
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,920
So this time,

418
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:33,799
if I find something more valuable,

419
00:22:35,400 --> 00:22:36,599
I want...

420
00:22:55,759 --> 00:22:57,759
Everything you need is in here.

421
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:05,839
And what about what you need?

422
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:08,240
Are they all in there? In the private room?

423
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:11,960
But Yu Songfan...

424
00:23:12,039 --> 00:23:13,920
knows all his colleagues' secrets,

425
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:15,119
yet never said a word.

426
00:23:15,359 --> 00:23:16,880
He really is a gentleman.

427
00:23:18,519 --> 00:23:19,519
For you to use these secrets

428
00:23:19,519 --> 00:23:21,079
in such a short amount of time

429
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,279
to turn half the court's staff

430
00:23:22,279 --> 00:23:23,319
into your friends...

431
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:25,519
You're quite the talent yourself.

432
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:28,960
For gear that can't go wrong, trust Navel Song.

433
00:23:33,920 --> 00:23:34,880
Here's a little gift for you.

434
00:23:40,640 --> 00:23:41,400
This here

435
00:23:42,079 --> 00:23:44,559
is a long-range tracker and bug.

436
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:46,160
You won't find it on the market.

437
00:23:46,279 --> 00:23:48,240
The signal won't drop even three meters underground.

438
00:23:48,559 --> 00:23:50,440
It records even breathing sounds crystal clear.

439
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:52,839
Hope you can put it to good use.

440
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:55,240
Thanks.

441
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,079
Ding Ning

442
00:24:14,599 --> 00:24:16,039
Navel Song, Yu Songfan...

443
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:18,279
coming straight to us would be more reliable.

444
00:24:18,799 --> 00:24:21,079
We shouldn't meet in public so often.

445
00:24:21,839 --> 00:24:24,200
You need to learn to ask for help,

446
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:26,079
instead of carrying everything yourself.

447
00:24:26,559 --> 00:24:28,440
We have plenty of resources at our disposal.

448
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:30,200
I can help you investigate a lot of things.

449
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,400
I have my ways.

450
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,640
Please trust me.

451
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:35,319
I know how to deal with Zhao Yijie.

452
00:24:35,319 --> 00:24:36,599
Of course I trust you.

453
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,039
But when you tell me nothing,

454
00:24:38,039 --> 00:24:39,480
it puts me in a very passive position.

455
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:41,599
I can't even protect you.

456
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,799
At the very least, whatever you know,

457
00:24:43,799 --> 00:24:45,000
I should know too.

458
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:47,240
No, you can't.

459
00:24:47,599 --> 00:24:48,799
Zhao Yijie is too good at

460
00:24:48,799 --> 00:24:50,000
mixing truth with lies.

461
00:24:50,599 --> 00:24:51,920
He uses all sorts of smokescreens

462
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:53,079
to divert your attention.

463
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:55,759
And to put it bluntly,

464
00:24:56,799 --> 00:24:58,799
you don't even know the rules of this game.

465
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:00,039
Then help me understand them.

466
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:04,160
Fine, I'll give you an example.

467
00:25:05,039 --> 00:25:07,519
When you and Zhao Yijie vanished and reappeared back-to-back,

468
00:25:07,559 --> 00:25:09,759
I even suspected for a moment that you were turned,

469
00:25:09,839 --> 00:25:11,480
and that the car crash was just a ruse.

470
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:13,599
Let me give you another example.

471
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:15,920
If he found out I was your mole,

472
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,599
he absolutely wouldn't expose me.

473
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:19,640
Instead, he'd use it to his advantage.

474
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:20,480
How so?

475
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:22,319
He'd still take me to meet his gang,

476
00:25:22,839 --> 00:25:24,640
except they'd all be scapegoats.

477
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:25,880
He'd put on a full show

478
00:25:25,880 --> 00:25:27,039
to make me believe it's real.

479
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:28,880
But the real masterminds

480
00:25:29,359 --> 00:25:31,160
would remain hidden in the dark.

481
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:34,319
He might have even guessed

482
00:25:34,319 --> 00:25:36,200
that we'd be arguing like this today.

483
00:25:36,839 --> 00:25:38,759
Guessed I wouldn't adapt well to working with you,

484
00:25:38,759 --> 00:25:40,319
and that I'd feel untrusted.

485
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:43,440
And then make you completely lose faith in us,

486
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,200
and finally believe

487
00:25:45,599 --> 00:25:48,640
that Zhao Yijie's gang is the best path for you.

488
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:49,519
Yes.

489
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:51,559
He wants to use you

490
00:25:51,559 --> 00:25:53,839
to grind away my remaining faith,

491
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:55,960
and make me become just like him.

492
00:26:05,759 --> 00:26:07,359
If you're really that worried,

493
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,200
you can use this to find me.

494
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:24,279
At the same time, the gravity of each atom

495
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:26,000
collapses toward the center,

496
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:27,599
delivering pressure and heat.

497
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:30,319
Since the sun's mass is so immense,

498
00:26:30,519 --> 00:26:31,759
its gravity

499
00:26:31,759 --> 00:26:33,680
can build up extremely high temperatures.

500
00:26:34,319 --> 00:26:35,240
The higher the temperature,

501
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:37,000
the faster the atomic nuclei move.

502
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:39,160
When it reaches 10 million degrees,

503
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,519
the electromagnetic force of the nuclei

504
00:26:40,519 --> 00:26:41,599
will be unable to stop

505
00:26:41,599 --> 00:26:43,920
the collisions of the fast-moving nuclei.

506
00:26:44,359 --> 00:26:44,839
And so,

507
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:48,079
the strong nuclear force instantly fuses them,

508
00:26:48,079 --> 00:26:50,400
releasing an enormous amount of energy.

509
00:26:51,519 --> 00:26:53,200
This is nuclear fusion.

510
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,359
It's the sun's...

511
00:26:54,799 --> 00:26:57,559
Teacher, I need to use the restroom.

512
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:58,359
Go ahead.

513
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:31,960
That's everything.

514
00:27:32,759 --> 00:27:34,440
Alright, let's go.

515
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:52,400
Awu!

516
00:27:54,079 --> 00:27:55,000
Brother Kevin!

517
00:27:58,759 --> 00:27:59,720
It's good that he moved away.

518
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:00,839
Now he won't have to worry

519
00:28:00,839 --> 00:28:02,839
about those online crazies hurting his family.

520
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:06,519
I'll be leaving in a few days too.

521
00:28:07,559 --> 00:28:08,319
Where to?

522
00:28:09,319 --> 00:28:10,039
Back to the UK.

523
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,039
By the way.

524
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:14,079
Since you're here,

525
00:28:14,319 --> 00:28:15,559
let's make another trip.

526
00:28:21,039 --> 00:28:21,960
I wanted to copy Lu Zhiyong,

527
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:23,039
but you won't let me pick the lock.

528
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,480
So what are we going to do now?

529
00:28:26,119 --> 00:28:29,039
It's... It's that old man.

530
00:28:29,559 --> 00:28:30,400
Grandpa!

531
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:34,839
He's the old man you took to the police station,

532
00:28:34,839 --> 00:28:35,480
right?

533
00:28:38,680 --> 00:28:40,599
Grandpa, it's me.

534
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:42,160
Do you remember me?

535
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:22,240
Must be nice being Lu Zhiyong.

536
00:29:42,119 --> 00:29:43,440
Navel Song provided a piece

537
00:29:43,440 --> 00:29:44,680
of evidence that can completely

538
00:29:44,680 --> 00:29:46,759
overturn Lu Zhiyong's murder case.

539
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:48,559
What evidence?

540
00:29:48,920 --> 00:29:50,799
When Navel Song was tailing Lao Kong,

541
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:52,519
he found out that after the incident, Lao Kong

542
00:29:52,519 --> 00:29:53,960
had been doing one thing.

543
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,680
That is, confirming that on New Year's Day,

544
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:57,160
there were no other surveillance videos

545
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:59,519
capturing Lu Zhiyong covering for the real killer.

546
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:01,400
Shouldn't Fan Dong's side

547
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:03,519
be doing the exact same thing?

548
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:04,400
Yeah.

549
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,279
But the problem is, they didn't get them.

550
00:30:06,359 --> 00:30:08,400
Lao Kong and his guys already got two.

551
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:09,400
Bought with money.

552
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:11,240
There's only one left that slipped through.

553
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:12,799
Only their place has a security camera.

554
00:30:13,279 --> 00:30:14,720
So how much cash do we have?

555
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:16,680
Why do you need cash?

556
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:17,440
To buy it, obviously.

557
00:30:18,279 --> 00:30:19,359
What year is it?

558
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:20,200
Who uses cash anymore?

559
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,119
We can just transfer it.

560
00:30:21,119 --> 00:30:21,759
Good point.

561
00:30:22,799 --> 00:30:24,839
But we still need a reason.

562
00:30:24,839 --> 00:30:26,839
They won't just sell it because you ask.

563
00:30:26,839 --> 00:30:28,119
Wouldn't they find it weird?

564
00:30:29,400 --> 00:30:30,839
Why don't we just tell him

565
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:33,200
our child went missing nearby,

566
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,720
so we need his security footage

567
00:30:34,720 --> 00:30:35,880
to take home and look through.

568
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:36,640
We'll appeal to his emotions.

569
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:37,319
You'll be the mom,

570
00:30:37,319 --> 00:30:38,480
and I'll be the grandpa.

571
00:30:38,599 --> 00:30:40,599
Then we give him 10,000 yuan...

572
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:41,720
Ten thousand?

573
00:30:43,599 --> 00:30:45,039
In case we can't move him,

574
00:30:45,039 --> 00:30:47,119
10,000 yuan will definitely sway him.

575
00:30:47,119 --> 00:30:48,359
Look at these small shops.

576
00:30:48,359 --> 00:30:50,359
10,000 yuan is a month's income for him.

577
00:30:50,359 --> 00:30:50,960
Right?

578
00:30:53,519 --> 00:30:54,319
Alright.

579
00:30:56,759 --> 00:30:58,359
Here, this is 50,000 yuan.

580
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:01,880
Hello.

581
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:02,920
Hold on, hold on.

582
00:31:04,519 --> 00:31:06,279
If we can use this footage

583
00:31:06,519 --> 00:31:07,720
to find my grandson,

584
00:31:07,799 --> 00:31:09,799
you'd be our family's great benefactor.

585
00:31:10,279 --> 00:31:11,599
As his grandpa,

586
00:31:11,759 --> 00:31:12,839
along with his mother,

587
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:14,440
we will be grateful to you forever.

588
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,200
Don't mention it.

589
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:16,200
Here, this is the card.

590
00:31:16,519 --> 00:31:17,160
Keep it safe.

591
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:19,079
I hope you find the child soon.

592
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:20,400
We'll get going then.

593
00:31:20,640 --> 00:31:21,359
Okay.

594
00:31:22,559 --> 00:31:23,279
Thank you so much.

595
00:31:28,119 --> 00:31:29,200
What do you want to buy?

596
00:31:31,759 --> 00:31:32,480
No, thanks.

597
00:31:47,880 --> 00:31:49,000
This guy looks familiar.

598
00:31:49,279 --> 00:31:50,319
He must be Lao Kong's man.

599
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:51,480
What do we do now?

600
00:31:52,480 --> 00:31:53,240
Let's follow him for now.

601
00:31:55,359 --> 00:31:56,160
Hold on a second.

602
00:31:56,559 --> 00:31:58,720
I saw you sneaking around just now. What are you up to?

603
00:31:58,720 --> 00:31:59,279
Hand it over.

604
00:31:59,279 --> 00:32:00,200
ID card. ID card.

605
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:00,880
Yu Songfan.

606
00:32:00,880 --> 00:32:01,599
What?

607
00:32:02,359 --> 00:32:02,640
Lao Yu.

608
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:14,639
There's dashcam footage.

609
00:34:15,119 --> 00:34:15,960
Yeah.

610
00:34:27,039 --> 00:34:28,480
The dashcam.

611
00:34:30,199 --> 00:34:31,639
The dashcam.

612
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:34,119
Where is it?

613
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:36,519
Where is it?

614
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:57,679
Have you ever wondered

615
00:34:58,760 --> 00:35:01,960
why good people have to go through eighty-one trials,

616
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:03,559
while bad people

617
00:35:03,920 --> 00:35:05,840
only have to lay down their butcher's knife

618
00:35:06,159 --> 00:35:08,119
to become a Buddha on the spot?

619
00:35:08,559 --> 00:35:09,920
Before you try to brainwash me again,

620
00:35:09,920 --> 00:35:10,920
I want to ask a question.

621
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:21,280
Making Lu the scapegoat,

622
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,199
does this also reflect your so-called...

623
00:35:23,199 --> 00:35:25,519
ideology of protecting good deeds in your own way?

624
00:35:26,119 --> 00:35:26,760
No.

625
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:30,400
But it can't be helped.

626
00:35:31,719 --> 00:35:32,840
If the real culprit gets caught,

627
00:35:32,840 --> 00:35:34,239
someone will be implicated.

628
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:36,840
It will affect all our future plans.

629
00:35:37,039 --> 00:35:37,880
What plans?

630
00:35:38,719 --> 00:35:39,639
Your escape plan?

631
00:35:40,079 --> 00:35:41,159
You swore to me

632
00:35:41,159 --> 00:35:42,280
that it was for some ideals and beliefs.

633
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:42,920
But in the end,

634
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:44,400
isn't it all just a facade

635
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:45,199
for your illegal activities?

636
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:47,079
Then why don't you look on the bright side?

637
00:35:47,760 --> 00:35:49,159
Didn't Lu get a chance

638
00:35:49,159 --> 00:35:50,639
to change his destiny against all odds?

639
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,239
If it weren't for this,

640
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,119
with his background,

641
00:35:56,119 --> 00:35:58,039
how many years would he have to struggle

642
00:35:58,199 --> 00:35:59,760
before he could afford a house and a car?

643
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:01,599
Before he could get a decent job?

644
00:36:02,280 --> 00:36:03,519
Before he could cross class barriers

645
00:36:03,519 --> 00:36:04,920
and live the life he's always wanted?

646
00:36:04,920 --> 00:36:05,880
What right do you have

647
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:07,119
to manipulate someone else's life?

648
00:36:07,119 --> 00:36:08,639
What gives you the right to choose for him?

649
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:09,920
I didn't.

650
00:36:10,239 --> 00:36:12,239
This was exactly his own choice.

651
00:36:13,599 --> 00:36:14,280
I told you,

652
00:36:14,280 --> 00:36:15,960
I don't force anyone to make choices.

653
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:19,679
Don't be fooled by the fact that Lu is just a kid.

654
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:22,039
He knows he has to seize this opportunity.

655
00:36:22,519 --> 00:36:23,920
Doing a few years in prison

656
00:36:24,280 --> 00:36:26,360
means he'll be set for life when he gets out.

657
00:36:26,519 --> 00:36:27,639
Tell me, if this kind of opportunity

658
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:29,079
were posted online,

659
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:31,480
wouldn't people fight tooth and nail for it?

660
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:33,320
Save that crap for someone else.

661
00:36:35,119 --> 00:36:37,280
The real culprit's father is Mr. Bi, right?

662
00:36:44,079 --> 00:36:44,719
Yes.

663
00:36:46,239 --> 00:36:47,199
I want to see him.

664
00:36:47,760 --> 00:36:49,079
Don't give me any more "today" or "tomorrow".

665
00:36:49,079 --> 00:36:49,960
I want a specific date.

666
00:36:49,960 --> 00:36:50,559
Next week.

667
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:54,960
I'll take you to see them next week.

668
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:58,800
However,

669
00:37:06,039 --> 00:37:07,000
there are two conditions.

670
00:37:10,079 --> 00:37:10,679
The first condition

671
00:37:10,679 --> 00:37:12,400
is that I finish Lu Zhiyong's case, right?

672
00:37:14,239 --> 00:37:14,960
And the second?

673
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:18,039
There's something that would make a great gift.

674
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:19,320
What?

675
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:21,159
Local News

676
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:22,760
Jiangliu Vice Mayor, Bi Wenhao,

677
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:24,800
visited Binjiang Subdistrict, Fulin District yesterday

678
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:27,159
to inspect the city's appearance and environment.

679
00:37:27,719 --> 00:37:29,800
Bi Wenhao led officials from the Urban Management Bureau,

680
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:31,440
Housing Bureau, and Environmental Protection Bureau

681
00:37:31,599 --> 00:37:33,800
on a site visit to the main and minor roads,

682
00:37:34,079 --> 00:37:36,159
historical building clusters, and riverside landscape.

683
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:37,159
Afterward,

684
00:37:37,159 --> 00:37:39,320
Bi Wenhao will visit the Fulin District Court in Jiangliu

685
00:37:39,599 --> 00:37:40,920
for a symposium with Vice President Cai Dongchu

686
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:43,480
and Deputy Chief Judge Qiu Qiming of the Criminal Division,

687
00:37:43,679 --> 00:37:45,199
to research criminal trial work.

688
00:37:53,280 --> 00:37:54,000
Where is it?

689
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:56,280
Where?
